Questions, complaints, requests for relief, and the exercise of privacy rights may be directed to the contact information above.

**Article 10 (Changes to This Privacy Policy)**

If this Privacy Policy changes, the Company will publish the changes and their effective date on this page. Changes that materially affect the rights of individuals will be announced in an easily accessible manner before they take effect.

*   Publication date: September 4, 2026
*   Effective date: September 4, 2026
